<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="v2-reference"><section class="about-intro"><div class="about-photo story-duo"><img src="<?= e(asset('editorial-v2/approach-textures.webp')) ?>" width="640" height="640" alt="Two women with distinct natural hair textures, photographed from behind"></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE AVELA APPROACH</p><h1>Your hair<br>comes first.</h1><p>Before the products, there’s you. Your texture, your habits, and the things you notice about your hair every day.</p><p>Avela brings those details into a clearer picture, so your routine has a place to start.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?= e(url('/assessment')) ?>">Get to know your hair </a></div></section><section class="section approach-process reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LESS GUESSWORK</p><h2>Thoughtful care.<br>Simple steps.</h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with your hair.</h3><p>A short assessment brings your texture, scalp, lengths, and styling habits together. You can add a few words of your own, too.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Make sense of the details.</h3><p>Avela recognizes familiar cosmetic concern words, then uses clear rules to organize general care guidance around your answers.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Bring care into your day.</h3><p>See wash-day steps and between-wash guidance separately. Save your outline, revisit it, and update your profile as your hair changes.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="about-image-story reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">THOUGHTFUL BY NATURE</p><h2>Room to notice.<br>Room to learn.</h2><p>Your hair is more than a single label. Everyday habits and the details you notice help build a fuller picture. Avela gives those details a place to come together.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?= e(url('/care-guide')) ?>">A little more knowing </a></div><img src="<?= e(asset('editorial-v2/approach-detail.webp')) ?>" width="640" height="640" alt="A close view of wavy hair resting gently over a hand" loading="lazy"></section><section class="about-principles"><h2>Clarity over<br>complication.</h2><div><p>You don’t need to know every term to begin. Avela’s texture guides and Not sure options leave room to learn.</p><p>Care notes point to their references, and your routine explains why each step appears. There’s room to adjust as you learn what works for your hair.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?= e(url('/care-guide')) ?>">Explore the care notes </a></div></section><section class="section about-privacy"><h2>A little space for you.<br>A choice that stays yours.</h2><div><p>Your hair profile is saved privately to your account. You can revisit your answers and update your assessment as your hair changes.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?= e(url('/privacy')) ?>">How your answers are saved </a></div></section><section class="guide-cta"><div><h2>Make a little room for you.</h2><p>Bring what you know about your hair into your own routine.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="<?= e(url('/assessment')) ?>">Build my hair profile </a></section></main>
